# Market data (RSI/MACD/backtests/everything) no longer needs a browser-side
# key at all — it's synced once a day by a GitHub Action into
# data/market-data.json, which the app reads directly. To enable that sync,
# set TWELVE_DATA_KEY as a repo secret (Settings > Secrets and variables >
# Actions), NOT here — this file is only for browser-side (VITE_-prefixed)
# variables. Get a free key at https://twelvedata.com.

# Optional. Without this, the price shown updates only once a day (from the
# synced snapshot above). With it, US stock/ETF prices update every ~30s via
# a lightweight client-side polling loop — a display-only overlay, doesn't
# affect any indicator or backtest.
# Get a free key at https://finnhub.io (free tier: 60 requests/min)
VITE_FINNHUB_KEY=
